## ASD SYSTEMS
Host asd-* git-test git*.ncsa.illinois.edu
    ProxyJump cerberus
#    PreferredAuthentications gssapi-with-mic,hostbased,publickey,keyboard-interactive,password
Host acer
    Hostname acer.ncsa.illinois.edu
    ProxyJump cerberus
    DynamicForward localhost:8087

